s-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"205f0b61-ec09-49d8-8828-50da79d98abd\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e When will the \u003cstrong\u003eUPHESC Assistant Professor Answer Key 2026 be released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: The answer key is usually released a few days after the exam.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Who releases \u003cstrong\u003ethe answer key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The answer key is released by \u003cstrong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Higher Education Services Commission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Is login required to \u003cstrong\u003edownload the answer key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e No, usually \u003cstrong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"700\"\u003eno login is required\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Can I raise objections \u003cstrong\u003eagainst the answer key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Yes, you can challenge the \u003cstrong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"938\"\u003eprovisional answer key\u003c/strong\u003e within the given time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website of the \u003cstrong\u003eUPHESC\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website of the \u003cstrong\u003eUPHESC \u003c/strong\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://upessc.up.gov.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-33783 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-58-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"UPHESC Assistant Professor Answer Key 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-58-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-58-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-58-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-58.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"gb-headline-text\"\u003eSarkari Result.Com.Cm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width:50%; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLatest Posts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/uphesc-assistant-professor-2026/\"\u003eUPHESC Assistant Professor Result 2026 – Out\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsc-cds-2-2026/\"\u003eUPSC CDS-II Online Form 2026 – Date Extend\u003c/a\u003